WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier...

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.680
and welcome to The Somewhat-Impossible Markiplier Quiz.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:10.620
Now I'm playing this game because number 1: it's my birthday, for real this time, no fooling...

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:14.140
Aaaannnd Number 2... I heard what this guy said about this game

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:17.520
And how he made it and how he got other people involved in it

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.260
and how it's his first flash animation project EVER!

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:25.300
And how he's really proud of it! He says, "My name is Nicholas Lovett, I have been watching your videos

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.280
"since Amnesia, and I loved your videos ever since. You're my idol, as you could say.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:33.180
"And I'm one of your fans, maybe not your "biggest" fan, but I admire your work a lot.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:37.200
"I had to rewatch some of your videos to get some of the information for the quiz, but it was worth it.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:42.200
"Anyways, I'm 18 (as of now), and I'm new to this whole animation stuff. So for my first complete flash

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.840
"animation, I thought it turned out pretty well. I'd have to say my favorite video of yours is when you played

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:50.280
"Bewilder House with the clown. I couldn't stop myself from laughing in class.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.660
"And yes I do watch your videos in school, because I need some entertainment XD.

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.120
"Anyways, enjoy the game! This is my way of giving back to the community!

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.200
"Also, some questions will be really easy, some will be hard, and some will require thinking outside the box.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.680
"And some question answers might not be the one you think is the correct one.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:09.880
"This game is dedicated to Mark, his fans, and my loving girlfriend, my Hand &lt;3"

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.300
So thank you, Nicholas so much for making this.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:19.980
And I wanna say that I don't think I've been observant enough about things that are made in the community.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:24.680
I-I play like this leadership role where I try to guide you guys around but...

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:30.140
I i-it's dawned on me and I get very self-reflective about it you know like my birthday and I'm getting older

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:34.860
And I remember when I started, and I realized that there's so many small things like this!

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:41.120
And the reason I didn't find this one is because it's actually kinda low rated and it gets lost in the shuffle

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.700
Because of, you know, things that people make, you know, gets higher rating and gets up higher

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:53.480
But I found this one, and, you know, I-I don't care that it's low rated or anything because it's his first project and it's

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:59.680
